{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/b846ca9989febb147ef96da891a45450.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=47 /></span><br>Narru is a narrative-driven puzzle game where the world is your canvas. Listen to the story that will guide you through a world full of memories and beauty to be discovered.<br><br>Set off on a journey to paint the world with life, learn about logic and emotions, and fulfill a mission given to you by your guardian and the creator of the world you explore: a powerful goddess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/4a7c217a8972ab891ac80e4e66ad1bf9.avif?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=79 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/14ccf281195e0ab44ac26ddbfe4ec786.poster.avif?t=1659096773\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/14ccf281195e0ab44ac26ddbfe4ec786.webm?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/14ccf281195e0ab44ac26ddbfe4ec786.mp4?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/763740d7f385ba9a983ccad3eb79785b.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=51 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/fcd8facafb5a5829ee39f23667b62109.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=47 /></span><br>Solve all different kinds of puzzles prepared for you to learn about logic. Listen to your guardian\u2019s voice, follow her hints and answer her questions to finish the journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/41d673772aa4aac80bbb44284f0baa38.poster.avif?t=1659096773\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/41d673772aa4aac80bbb44284f0baa38.webm?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/41d673772aa4aac80bbb44284f0baa38.mp4?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/e2744bb831d29d5391017d42b73c7e7e.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/72f04aa3ce7f7942349a19809d556bc2.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=47 /></span><br>Collect keys and unlock more biomes and locations which you can access from a special dimension that connects all of them. Every biome will challenge you with unique puzzles and offer new stories to discover and learn from.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/b0600e0f3556381f7fa7b6d0e0faa20f.poster.avif?t=1659096773\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/b0600e0f3556381f7fa7b6d0e0faa20f.webm?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/b0600e0f3556381f7fa7b6d0e0faa20f.mp4?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/e2744bb831d29d5391017d42b73c7e7e.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/6374b71d1f8dce88d55564094565fd61.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=47 /></span><br>On your way, you will find stone human statues that will show you all kinds of stories from human life. Observe them and, with the goddess\u2019 help, draw conclusions that will allow you to better understand human emotions and behaviors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dc0327d168a4fe87495d43db962e618d.poster.avif?t=1659096773\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dc0327d168a4fe87495d43db962e618d.webm?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/dc0327d168a4fe87495d43db962e618d.mp4?t=1659096773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/e2744bb831d29d5391017d42b73c7e7e.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876010/extras/fdb4657acd05feeb332b87be19908cdc.webp?t=1659096773\" width=610 height=47 /></span><br>Your journey will teach you about human lives, logic, and emotions. But it will also give you a chance to fill the world with life and beauty, casting your light over the empty lands. Explore